{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01XLBn8yFh7YsWN3LWZYftBZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FwPVkoqAMrCxdxYVd1Hb4L","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# KEY_DECISIONS — SOS card implementation run\n\nLightweight log of ambiguities, deviations from TODO.md, and deliberate\ncard-local limitations. One short entry each.\n\n## Engine changes beyond E1–E3 (justified by a real card need)\n\n- **AttacksTriggeredEvent is never fired** by the engine (combat.py). sos_1's\n  attack trigger (and fdn_194 Etali) depend on it. Added a single `fire_event`\n  in `declare_attackers_step` for each declared attacker, populating\n  `creature=` and `attacker=`. Additive, mirrors how other turn-based events fire.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":185998,"cache_read_input_tokens":15913,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":185998},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8da52e5e-8a7f-49b6-ba2f-528c6b227c8c","uuid":"4bfadd00-cff7-4c1f-946a-219f7070fe28","request_id":"req_011CbvaT7tzLh8jFT1V31MC6"}
