{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Bw1HNpYWXJMp6C89nFa6Sr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 13 checklist items are complete (3 shared engine changes + 10 cards), each committed individually, and the working tree is clean.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented all ten SOS cards through the real engine, working the checklist in order and testing each card against the spec before moving on.\n\n**Shared engine seams (built first, reused by ≥2 cards):**\n- **E1** — fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell` (drives sos_226 casualty, sos_257 pump).\n- **E2** — added/fired `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` from `advance_phase` (drives sos_57 delayed mana, sos_120 Paradigm).\n- **E3** — battlefield cost-reduction aggregation via `spell_cost_reduction` (drives sos_245's affinity grant).\n\n**The ten cards:** sos_4 (Converge), sos_1 (cost reduction + free-cast attack trigger + exile-instead), sos_245 (affinity self + grant), sos_226 (casualty/copy), sos_257 (restricted-mana land + in-place animation), sos_57 (counter + delayed mana), sos_120 (cast-from-exile + Paradigm copies), sos_13 (DFC token + prepared/Swords), sos_201 (miracle + loot), sos_97 (planeswalker: surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip skip-turns).\n\n**Additional small additive engine edits**, each justified by a real card need and logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`: fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent` (was never fired); an `_exile_instead_of_graveyard` flag + `mana_spent` record in `_resolve_spell`/`cast_spell`; restricted-mana support in `ManaPool` (`instant_sorcery_only` + `allow_restricted`); `game.rng`; `player.skip_turns` + advance-phase honor-skip; and `LoyaltyAbilityInstance.targets` → `chosen_targets` wiring.\n\n**Verification:** every card has 5–10 focused tests driven through `test_utils` plus an independent throwaway smoke check re-derived from the spec. Final state — **1249 passed** (1145 engine regression tests unchanged, 65 SOS, 39 FDN reference), no regressions. Engine changes were strictly additive: no existing symbol was renamed, moved, or deleted, and `engine_tests/`/FDN tests were untouched."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":996,"cache_read_input_tokens":399713,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":996},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8da52e5e-8a7f-49b6-ba2f-528c6b227c8c","uuid":"2ac7c4cc-420a-41e6-89b8-5aa0a4570ad8","request_id":"req_011CbvdGmi8LJ6jtj9K2FfHE"}
